pyproject.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-tongyi.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-siliconflow.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-siliconflow-mysql.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-openai.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-ollama.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-litellm.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-infiniai.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-deepseek.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-burncloud.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-proxy-aimlapi.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-vllm.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-qwen3.example.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-qwen.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-mlx.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-llama-cpp.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-llama-cpp-server.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-local-glm.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-graphrag.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-cloud-storage.example.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-bm25-rag.toml\n./configs/dbgpt-app-config.example.toml\n- Build next-generation **AI + Data assistants** for your team or product\n\n## Product Workflow\n\n### Explore data\nConnect files, databases, and knowledge bases in one workspace.\n\n### Plan and execute\nLet AI reason through the task, write SQL and code, and execute step by step.\n\n### Use skills\nLoad reusable skills for repeatable business analysis workflows.\n\n### Generate reports\nProduce charts, dashboards, HTML reports, and decision-ready outputs.\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nGet DB-GPT running in minutes with the one-line installer (macOS & Linux):\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eosphoros-ai/DB-GPT/main/scripts/install/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nOr specify a profile and API key directly:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eosphoros-ai/DB-GPT/main/scripts/install/install.sh \\\n  | OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxx bash -s -- --profile openai\n```\n\nFor Kimi 2.5 via Moonshot API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eosphoros-ai/DB-GPT/main/scripts/install/install.sh \\\n  | MOONSHOT_API_KEY=sk-xxx bash -s -- --profile kimi\n```\n\nFor MiniMax via the OpenAI-compatible API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.c